From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Wikman <lars@underjord.io>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: rover: disable Venus

The watch ships no video firmware, and nothing on it decodes video.
Venus probed, enabled its core, bus and vcodec clocks, failed to load
its firmware and left them enabled: XO-fed GCC branches that keep the
GCC requesting XO through any sleep. Its failed probe also left the
GCC's sync_state pending.

Signed-off-by: Lars Wikman <lars@underjord.io>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm429w-mobvoi-rover.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm429w-mobvoi-rover.dts
@@ -710,6 +710,15 @@
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+/*
+ * No video firmware is shipped for the watch. Venus enabled its clocks,
+ * failed to load firmware and never released them, which kept XO on and
+ * the GCC's sync_state pending.
+ */
+&venus {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
+
 &xo_board {
 	clock-frequency = <19200000>;
 };
-- 
